Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:07.28,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:11.68,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2012.893,200.557)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:17.23,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2012.893,200.557)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.24,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So this is going to be a short video of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.13,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,what I think is the most obscene thing Microsoft has done yet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.52,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I've been experimenting on the latest build of Windows for a couple days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:23.02,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,as the insiders broke the news about the new rejuvenated blue screen of death
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.84,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,For one thing it's black again but nothing comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.08,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,close to what I've discovered just now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:37.45,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Everybody's talking about the beta branch where Microsoft released the build 26120.3653
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and the exclusion of the bypass NRO script
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:50.41,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I decided to dig a little deeper and I selected the dev branch and promptly updated to the newer build 26200.5516
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:56.90,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,because I couldn't enable the new version of the bug check on the beta build as stated in the previous video
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:04.45,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So I enabled the new bug check feature using Vive tool on this version And what do you think I found Watch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:09.67,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,They put an ad for one drive in the bug check
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:14.43,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,A blue screen of death that's now green contains an ad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.91,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Microsoft what the hell are you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:25.14,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,This is actually a new low What lobotomized loser decided having an ad in a bug check is a good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.78,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm equally astonished and disgusted by this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:30.96,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,What the hell Microsoft?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:33.11,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay let's freeze frame and read this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:37.46,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Get the best deal on your cloud storage with Microsoft 365
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:42.38,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Never lose your work again as your documents save automatically to the cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.43,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Plus enjoy one tabyte of storage and the full Office suit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:50.56,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,All for just $6.99 a month with your Office 365 subscription
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And there's a QR code Well let let me scan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:05.77,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,OneDrive.com All right dude just this is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:15.15,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah this is this is a thing Microsoft put an ad in a blue screen of death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:20.00,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can surprise me anymore And apparently there is a new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:23.64,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,registry value you have to set to disable the ad on debug check
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:28.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So you have to go ahead and open the registry editor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.84,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Then you have to navigate to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:50.76,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,inside of here you have to create two values
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:58.37,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,The first one is a DWORD called DisplayParameters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Then you have to set it to four
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:07.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Next you have to create another one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:11.29,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,another DWORD called DisablePromo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:14.07,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And then you have to set it to one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.56,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,And this way the ad is never going to be shown again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:24.04,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So let's go ahead and try that out We have to reboot first though
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.13,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So shut down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:28.90,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.57,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I forgot it doesn't accept the arguments Great
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.60,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Let's use the command prompt then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:43.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay we're back in the system So let's go ahead and check this out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.22,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Once we crash we shouldn't see the ad anymore All right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:57.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly this is pretty baffling but somewhat expected from Microsoft
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:04.06,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Once there's extra space on the bug check of course it's going to be filled with an advertisement despicable
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:09.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder though why exactly the new display parameters are four and one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:13.56,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess that's just another arbitrary bit mask value from Microsoft
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:21.23,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching I'm really disappointed I might actually make the move to Linux now Take care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.24,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这是一个简短的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.13,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,讲述我认为微软迄今为止做过的最令人发指的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.52,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我已经在最新版本的Windows上测试了好几天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:23.02,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,因为内测用户们爆料了关于新版蓝屏死机的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.84,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,首先，它又变黑了，但与我刚刚发现的一切相比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.08,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这些都算不了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:37.45,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,大家都在讨论微软发布的26120.3653版本测试分支
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,以及绕过NRO脚本被移除的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:50.41,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我决定再深入探究一下，于是选择了开发分支并更新至较新的版本26200.5516
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:56.90,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我在测试版中无法按照之前视频所说的启用新版本的错误检查功能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:04.45,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,于是我在这版本上用Vive工具开启了新错误检查功能。你猜我发现了什么，看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:09.67,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,他们将 OneDrive 的广告放在错误检查的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:14.43,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,之前的蓝屏现在变成带广告的绿屏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.91,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,微软又发什么抽 (`へ´≠)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:25.14,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是刷新了下限，是哪个脑残的失败者觉得在错误检查里插广告是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.78,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,对此我既震惊又厌恶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:30.96,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,说你呢微软 (`д´)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:33.11,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,好的，让我们停在这个画面，看一下是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:37.46,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,用 Microsoft 365 享云端存储最优价
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:42.38,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,从此无惧丢失工作成果，文档自动同步云端更安心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.43,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,另享1TB存储+完整Office套件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:50.56,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,仅需每月$6.99，Office 365订阅全包含
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这有个二维码，扫扫看有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:05.77,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,OneDrive.com 好吧，这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:15.15,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,没错，微软在蓝屏死机画面里植入了广告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:20.00,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,已经没有什么能让我感到惊讶了，显然现在还得设置一个新的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:23.64,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,注册表值才能禁用调试检查中的广告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:28.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你得打开注册表编辑器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.84,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,导航到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:50.76,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在这里你需要创建两个值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:58.37,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,第一个是一个名为{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}DisplayParameters{\r}的{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}DWORD{\r}值
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,将它设为{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}4
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:07.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,再建另一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:11.29,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,另一个叫做{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}DisablePromo{\r}的{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}DWORD{\r}值
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:14.07,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,将它设为{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&}1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.56,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这样广告就不会显示了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:24.04,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,那我们继续试试看吧，不过得先重启一下系统
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.13,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,关个机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:28.90,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.57,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我忘了它不接受这样的参数 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.60,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,那用命令提示符吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:43.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,好的，我们回到了系统里，继续往下看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.22,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,一旦崩溃，我们就不会再看到广告了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:57.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这挺让人困惑的，不过是微软的话也算是意料之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:04.06,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,一旦错误检查页面上有多余的空间，它肯定会被可鄙的广告填满
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:09.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,不过我想知道为什么新的显示参数是4和1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:13.56,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我猜那不过是微软又一个随意的位掩码值罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:21.23,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,感谢观看，我真的很失望，现在可能真的要转投Linux了。生活愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:16.56,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1917.823,253.357)}原标题：They Put an Ad into the Blue Screen of Death 原作者：Enderman
